      "ABI9: initial pulse and re-kicks share one124ms/512-record window. start1 means latest vector boundary, not first ACCEPT. Every vector first2ms dense, otherwise1in4; all ACCEPT retained. Gaps are all-off releases; metadata identifies ignored/usable events.",
